        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# How Long Is This Transcript\n\nTranscribes a clip and counts the tokens in the transcript. Check this before sending a transcript to a model that bills per token or limits context.\n\n**How it works:** \"Clip\" passes the video to \"Extract audio\". \"Transcribe\" turns the audio into English text. \"Count tokens\" is a Code node that counts the tokens in that text, and \"Count\" shows the number. Pick a speech recognition model on \"Transcribe\".\n\n**Try this:** Set the language on \"Transcribe\" to match a non-English clip, then compare its token count with an English clip of the same length."
        },
